<title>USA: Alberto-Culver unit expands into Germany.</title>
<headline>Alberto-Culver unit expands into Germany.</headline>
<dateline>MELROSE PARK, Ill. 1996-09-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Alberto-Culver Co said Thursday its Sally Beauty Co has expanded into Germany with the purchase of a six-store regional chain.</p>
<p>This marks the second recent international expansion for Sally, which distributes professional beauty supplies worldwide. Last year, the chain announced a joint venture agreement taking it into Japan where it now operates 14 stores.</p>
<p>Sally also has operated in the United Kingdom since 1987 and has 58 locations there.</p>
<p>	   -- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
